// User guide and Help
"User guide (English)" = "用户指南（英文）";
"File → Open Apple Photos… opens your System Photo Library or an album, with an optional date range. Review images load as you browse and exclude Photos edits." = "“文件 → 打开 Apple 照片…”可打开系统照片图库或相簿，并可选择日期范围。浏览时按需加载图像，不包含在“照片”中所做的编辑。";
"Settings → General → iCloud Access has separate choices for review images and originals. Photos may download source data for a review image. Open Original Detail, video playback, and Copy request originals separately." = "“设置 → 通用 → iCloud 访问”分别控制浏览图像和原始文件的下载。“照片”可能需要下载源数据来生成浏览图像。“打开原始细节”、视频播放和“复制”会单独请求原始文件。";
"Ratings stay local. File → Add to Album… adds items only after confirmation and preserves existing memberships. Copy exports primary originals; Move, Rename, Organize, XMP, and Trash are unavailable for Photos." = "评分保存在本机。“文件 → 添加到相簿…”仅在确认后添加项目，且保留现有相簿归属。“复制”导出主要原始文件；“照片”不支持移动、重命名、整理、XMP 和移到废纸篓。";
"File safety and saved decisions" = "文件安全与已保存的决定";
"Export copies by default. Move transfers originals and cannot be undone. Rename and Organize change file names or locations only after confirmation." = "导出默认复制文件。移动会转移原始文件，且无法撤销。重命名和整理仅在确认后更改文件名或位置。";
"Clean Up asks before moving files to Trash. ⌘⌫ trashes the selection without a dialog. ⌘Z restores trashed files during the open session while they remain in Trash." = "清理会先询问，再将文件移到废纸篓。⌘⌫ 无需对话框便会将所选项目移到废纸篓。在会话仍打开且文件仍在废纸篓中时，⌘Z 可将其恢复。";
"Folder ratings save to .louppe_session.json; File → Check Saved Decisions… offers recovery. Photos ratings save locally by asset ID." = "文件夹评分保存在 .louppe_session.json 中；“文件 → 检查已保存的决定…”提供恢复功能。“照片”的评分按资源 ID 保存在本机。";
